To help Jordan get an accurate picture of their grocery spending, I'll first gather the data.

1. **Check to get the total grocery spends for October 2026:**
   ```json
   {
     "tool": "get_balance",
     "arguments": {
       "account_id": "CARD-1",
       "start_date": "2026-10-01",
       "end_date": "2026-10/31"
     }
   },
   {
     "tool": "list_transactions",
     "arguments": {
       "account_id": "CARD-1",
       "start_date": "2026-10-01",
       "end_date": "2026-10-31",
       "categories": ["GREENLEAF GROCERS", "HOLLOWBROOK MARKET", "WELLWAY PHARMACY"]
     }
   }
   ```

